# Summary

The handbook states that vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook [[cite:obs-29920e86e66c0fb6e3ff61b84d9e60e4f2cd4cae "Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook."]].

The appendix specifies that bays twelve through thirty are blocked and reserved for supplier vans only, with a midday deadline [[cite:obs-dfbe9c7ca619892a2e8e8d2c4fe8c47d0dd53040 "Bays twelve through thirty: blocked, supplier vans only, midday deadline."]].
